OL,3,GNEWSAAxing night levy won't reduce
OL,4,Asafety, bosses say
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbolishing a city's night-time levy
OL,7,Fused to pay for enhanced security will
OL,8,Fnot lead to a decline in revellers'
OL,9,Fsafety, bosses have said.
OL,11,FNewcastle City Council will consider
OL,12,Faxing the extra charge paid by pubs and
OL,13,Fclubs following requests from
OL,14,Fbusinesses facing rising costs.
OL,16,FThe Late Night Levy has been in force
OL,17,Fsince 2013, charging an annual fee of
OL,18,Fbetween #299 and #4,400 to businesses
OL,19,Fwith a licence to sell alcohol between
OL,20,Fmidnight and 06:00.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
