OL,3,GNEWSAAxing night levy won't reduce
OL,4,Asafety, bosses say
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Newcastle Business Improvement
OL,7,FDistrict (BID) company NE1, which
OL,8,Fcampaigned for the fee to be dropped,
OL,9,Fsaid safety measures paid for through
OL,10,Fthe levy would not be under threat.
